      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As a semi-mute that's gotten timed out from spam detection during a normal conversation, I find it extremely annoying. I don't any problem spamming the text box would cause past affection servers, at which point it should be actions against that specific user. Maybe causing the new message noise? But people can just block the user.\n\nText is a vital form of communication, and the current spam detection is way to low. Either increase it, or get rid of it all together. I can type almost as fast as talking and I've gotten timed out from it. Both in vr and on desktop.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
