      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If Chatbox Spam is ever a problem then add an option for users to close out problematic people the same way you do with being able to turn off audio from user's microphones and avatars.  I don't even know if this is option exists already because I have never looked, never had a reason to try to find a way to turn off the chat box.\n\nThis is actively infringing on the accessibility of users who need these features in an attempt to fix or prevent something that is as far as I can tell a non-issue.",
